pping rate should leave a light residual haze in your beer after maturation. Don’t worry, this comes from the hop compounds, haze is taste.","contributed_by":"John Jenkman <johnjenkman>"}', '["Kilden oppgir ikke alfasyre. IBU vises fra oppskriftens mål; legg inn alfasyre for egne beregninger."]', 1790238832282);
