 & Spice) flavours, ferment at a higher temperature. If you want more fruit esters, keep the fermentation lower and under control.\n\nFørst brygget: 2017"}', '{"id":276,"name":"Nine To Five Wizard","tagline":"India Pale Weizen.","first_brewed":"2017","description":"A classic German weissbeir with aromas of banana and clove, layered with New World hop aromas of orange.","image":"276.png","abv":7.5,"ibu":35,"target_fg":1012,"target_og":1069,"ebc":20,"srm":10,"ph":4.3,"attenuation_level":83,"volume":{"value":20,"unit":"litres"},"boil_volume":{"value":25,"unit":"litres"},"method":{"mash_temp":[{"temp":{"value":65,"unit":"celsius"},"duration":30}],"fermentation":{"temp":{"value":24,"unit":"celsius"}},"twist":null},"ingredients":{"malt":[{"name":"Pale Ale","amount":{"value":3.6,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Wheat","amount":{"value":2.34,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Double Roasted Crystal","amount":{"value":0.12,"unit":"kilograms"}}],"hops":[{"name":"Magnum","amount":{"value":8,"unit":"grams"},"add":"70","attribute":"Bittering"},{"name":"Cascade","amount":{"value":2,"unit":"grams"},"add":"10","attribute":"Flavour"},{"name":"Mandarina Bavaria","amount":{"value":2,"unit":"grams"},"add":"10","attribute":"Flavour"},{"name":"Ariana","amount":{"value":2,"unit":"grams"},"add":"10","attribute":"Flavour"},{"name":"Cascade","amount":{"value":10,"unit":"grams"},"add":"0","attribute":"Aroma"},{"name":"Mandarina Bavaria","amount":{"value":10,"unit":"grams"},"add":"0","attribute":"Aroma"},{"name":"Ariana","amount":{"value":10,"unit":"grams"},"add":"0","attribute":"Aroma"}],"yeast":"Wyeast 3638 - Bavarian Wheat™"},"food_pairing":["Grilled Portobello Mushroom Burger","Citrus Salad With Balsamic Dressing","Ginger And Orange Cookies"],"brewers_tips":"If you want more phenolic (Banana & Spice) flavours, ferment at a higher temperature. If you want more fruit esters, keep the fermentation lower and under control.","contributed_by":"John Jenkman <johnjenkman>"}', '["Kilden oppgir ikke alfasyr