: 700g, Fenugreek Seeds: 2g\n\nFørst brygget: 2019"}', '{"id":391,"name":"Sticky Black (Fanzine)","tagline":"Maple and Coffee Barley Wine.","first_brewed":"2019","description":"A maple and coffee barley wine brewed for Fanzine January issue.","image":"391.png","abv":11,"ibu":50,"target_fg":1020,"target_og":1105,"ebc":100,"srm":51,"ph":4.4,"attenuation_level":81,"volume":{"value":20,"unit":"litres"},"boil_volume":{"value":25,"unit":"litres"},"method":{"mash_temp":[{"temp":{"value":64,"unit":"celsius"},"duration":135}],"fermentation":{"temp":{"value":21,"unit":"celsius"}},"twist":"Coffee: 47g FV Addition, Natural Maple Syrup: 8g FV Addition, Jaggery: 700g, Fenugreek Seeds: 2g"},"ingredients":{"malt":[{"name":"Pale Ale","amount":{"value":7.015,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Caramalt","amount":{"value":0.554,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Simpsons T50","amount":{"value":0.369,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Chocolate Wheat","amount":{"value":0.185,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Extra Dark Crystal Malt","amount":{"value":0.092,"unit":"kilograms"}},{"name":"Beech Smoked Malt","amount":{"value":0.092,"unit":"kilograms"}}],"hops":[{"name":"Hallertauer Taurus","amount":{"value":15,"unit":"grams"},"add":"85","attribute":"Bitter"},{"name":"East Kent Golding","amount":{"value":31,"unit":"grams"},"add":"15","attribute":"Flavour"}],"yeast":"Wyeast 1272"},"food_pairing":["Long Clawson Stilton","Tarta de Higos","Caramelised Apple and Nutmeg Pie"],"brewers_tips":"Add coffee after the boil to get more coffee flavour and less bitterness.","contributed_by":"Alexander Ivanovsky <alxiw>"}', '["Kilden oppgir ikke alfasyre. IBU vises fra oppskriftens mål; legg inn alfasyre for egne beregninger."]', 1790238832282);
